# TypeScript's incremental build cache. It is a derived artefact — a binary record of
# which files `tsc` has already seen — and it changes on every build, so tracking it
# puts a diff in every commit that says nothing about the change. It was tracked from
# the initial commit and is untracked here rather than left to churn.
